<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<!--
  LedgerFlow's icon, "two books" (owner's choice, 2026-10-02): a debit page and
  a credit page side by side and never touching: the rule that the two
  ledgers never mix (CLAUDE.md Law 2). Original geometry, drawn for this app;
  colours are the dark theme's debit and credit (LfColors). Each page is one
  even-odd path, so the three ruled lines are holes rather than dark strokes:
  the monochrome layer reuses the same path data unchanged.

  Adaptive-icon canvas 108 x 108; everything sits inside the 66 dp safe circle
  (furthest corner 32.6 dp from the centre), so no launcher mask clips it.
  docs/brand/ledgerflow-icon.svg is the same geometry for the store graphics.
-->
